  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> x2 Base Weapon Cost [Minimum 1,000eb]<br>\n<strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0<br>\n<strong>Fits:</strong> All Ranged Weapons that only fire Bullets, Slugs, and/or Shells</p>\n<p>Needs a DV24 Weaponstech check and can't be removed. The weapon loses Autofire, Suppressive Fire, and Burst Fire; all its BODY requirements rise by 3; and it must work its bolt (an Action) after each shot, though ROF is unchanged. Its ammo costs double, is one Price Category higher, and only fits it. In exchange: +2d6 damage in Single Shot and with shells, and beyond 25m/yds it gets +1 on attacks against DV21+ (+2 against DV24+).</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Costs twice the base weapon's cost (minimum 1,000eb); the listed price is the minimum.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Internal Components).</em></p>"
